# Raw Forum records, transcripts, frames, embeddings and features contain classmates, so they
# stay local under data/. Exception (Brady, 13 Oct): the outputs of step 2 (cleaning) and
# step 3 (split) hold only class ids, courses, dates, titles and his own attendance, and are
# committed as part of the assignment.
data/*
!data/02_clean/
!data/03_split/
outputs/
*.mp4
*.ogg
*.wav

# FORUM_COOKIE lives here. It is a login credential.
.env

# Audit material (contact sheets, clips) and local tables/arrays. Only the privacy-safe
# results bundle is committed (HMAC ids, no words).
audit/
*.parquet
*.npy
!results/*.parquet
